# aux-fixed-before: Can an aux column share its name with a later fixed quantity (XPPAUT 8.2.2)?
# xpp: f=7 g=3
# pc: ok
# ruling: pc-ode accepts it, in either order. The name resolves to the fixed quantity, so `aux g=f` is 2*x+1 (language.md, Names and order).
x'=-x
x(0)=1
aux f=7*x
f=2*x+1
aux g=f
@ total=1,dt=0.5
